{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"typealias","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Value","kind":"identifier"},{"text":" = (","kind":"text"},{"text":"any","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Decodable","preciseIdentifier":"s:Se","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Yams\/documentation\/Yams","doc:\/\/Yams\/documentation\/Yams\/AliasDereferencingStrategy"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Yams\/documentation\/Yams\/AliasDereferencingStrategy\/Value"},"sections":[],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"typealias","roleHeading":"Type Alias","role":"symbol","title":"AliasDereferencingStrategy.Value","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Value","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:4Yams26AliasDereferencingStrategyP5Valuea","modules":[{"name":"Yams"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"typealias"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Value"}]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/yams\/aliasdereferencingstrategy\/value"]}],"abstract":[{"text":"The stored exestential type of all AliasDereferencingStrategys","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://Yams/documentation/Yams/AliasDereferencingStrategy/Value":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"typealias"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Value"}],"type":"topic","title":"AliasDereferencingStrategy.Value","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/yams\/aliasdereferencingstrategy\/value","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Value"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The stored exestential type of all AliasDereferencingStrategys","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Yams\/documentation\/Yams\/AliasDereferencingStrategy\/Value"},"doc://Yams/documentation/Yams":{"role":"collection","type":"topic","title":"Yams","kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Yams\/documentation\/Yams","url":"\/documentation\/yams"},"doc://Yams/documentation/Yams/AliasDereferencingStrategy":{"title":"AliasDereferencingStrategy","url":"\/documentation\/yams\/aliasdereferencingstrategy","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"AliasDereferencingStrategy"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"AliasDereferencingStrategy"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"A class-bound protocol which implements a strategy for dereferencing aliases (or dealiasing) values during","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"YAML document decoding. YAML documents which do not contain anchors will not benefit from the use of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"an AliasDereferencingStrategy in any way. The main use-case for dereferencing aliases in a YML document","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is when decoding into class types. If the yaml document is large and contains many references","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(perhaps it is a representation of a dense graph) then, decoding into structs will require the of large amounts","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of system memory to represent highly redundant (duplicated) data structures.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"However, if the same document is decoded into class types and the decoding uses","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"an ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AliasDereferencingStrategy"},{"text":" such as ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"BasicAliasDereferencingStrategy"},{"text":" then the emitted value will have its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"class references coalesced. No duplicate objects will be initialized (unless identical objects have multiple","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"distinct anchors in the YAML document). In some scenarios this may significantly reduce the memory footprint of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the decoded type.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Yams\/documentation\/Yams\/AliasDereferencingStrategy"}}}